                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "god\nDAMN is this game programmed like complete and total garbage\nand the difficulty system was initially confusing because of how fucking buggy the menus are\nyou have no hope of being stealthy in a game this buggy where all the glitches completely screw you over\na dude outside the room i was in\nhad a visibility cone that went thru the wall\nand therefore he \"technically\" saw me despite us being in entirely different rooms and it being impossible for his line of sight to be on me\nbut because his visibility cone went thru the goddamn wall and the light touched my sprite he instantly knew i was in an entirely different room and caught me\nif that isnt the pinnacle of badly programmed stealth game i dont know what is\ni managed to get \"good\" at it but it was still ungodly tedious\nalso i 100%ed the game and the game didnt give me the fukcing achivemenet for it great programming hahahahahahahhaahahahahahahahahaha cock",
